NOTICE — Third-party Gazebo models vendored in this repository
==============================================================

The directory src/tb3_bringup/models/ contains five vendored Gazebo models,
from two different sources:

  * Entries 1-3 were copied verbatim from a local Gazebo Classic model cache
    (~/.gazebo/models). They were originally distributed through the Gazebo
    model database (the online library historically fetched by Gazebo Classic
    from models.gazebosim.org, maintained in the OSRF "gazebo_models"
    repository, https://github.com/osrf/gazebo_models).
  * Entries 4-5 were downloaded from Gazebo Fuel and DO carry published
    license terms, transcribed in full below.

They are vendored here so that the simulation works offline on a fresh
machine, because the online model database is deprecated and slow/unreliable
to fetch from.

IMPORTANT — license status: NONE of the three cache-copied model directories
(entries 1-3) contains a bundled LICENSE/COPYING file. For those three, the
information below is a verbatim transcription of each model's model.config
metadata (the only authorship/licensing-related information shipped inside
the model directories). No compliance judgement has been made; licensing must
be reviewed manually before public redistribution. (For reference only: the
upstream osrf/gazebo_models repository declares its content to be
Apache License 2.0 / CC-BY 4.0 at repository level, but the vendored copies
themselves carry no license text.)

